  "slug": "appliance-repair-warranty-request-form",
  "title": "Appliance Repair Warranty Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Control diagnosis, repair, maintenance, testing, and return to use through verified identity, domain-specific observations, evidence, authorization, exception ownership, and accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An original, workflow-complete appliance repair warranty request for appliances and utility connections. It connects manufacturer service information, approved scope, and customer authorization to present conditions, repeatable evidence, decisions, unresolved work, and the receiving party's handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use when a service coordinator must investigate a appliance repair warranty or callback without treating the request as a coverage decision before identity, chronology, condition, and evidence are reviewed.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
